    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "当设计指标包含误差常数要求时，波特图法更为适用，因为在s平面上设计的系统，其误差常数必须在选定校正装置的极点和零点之后才能确定。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "When the design specifications include an error constant requirement, the Bode plot method is more suitable, because the error constant of a system designed on the s-plane must be ascertained following the choice of a compensator pole and zero.",
